DESCRIPTION >
    Atomic visibility markers for versioned conversion journeys. The latest
    committed version replaces every older row for the same conversion.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `conversion_id` String `json:$.conversion_id`,
    `profile_id` Nullable(String) `json:$.profile_id`,
    `batch_version` UInt64 `json:$.batch_version`,
    `batch_id` String `json:$.batch_id`,
    `committed_at` DateTime64(6) `json:$.committed_at`,
    `journey_row_count` UInt64 `json:$.journey_row_count`,
    `is_deleted` UInt8 `json:$.is_deleted`

ENGINE ReplacingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, conversion_id
ENGINE_VER batch_version
